  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Hearthband",
    "summary": "Whenever one of your **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** models attacks with a weapon, if the target is in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of the model's unit or is the closest eligible target:\n\n- the attack can re-roll a 1 to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)\n- if the model is part of one of your **KÂHL**, **EINHYR HEARTHGUARD** or **ÛTHAR THE DESTINED** units, the attack gets +1 AP",
